@segment 32-35 Ashenvale II & Desolace
@start-level 32
# Dwarf, any class (made from the Gnome route by tools/derive_anyclass.py). From the Dwarf route's segment 12: same quests, order, binds and flights. It had no
# class quests; only class abilities were taken out and the combat hints made class-neutral.
# Changed: the second-hearth jump from Shael'dryn's moonwell to Astranaar is now a walk west along the road (the
# Hearthstone is needed 20-30 minutes later, after the furbolg camp). The three returns to Nijel's Point use the
# Hearthstone alone: each loop between them takes over an hour, and each step says to walk if it is not ready.
# Carry-in: 1026 (Shael'dryn), 1453 (Kreldig Ungor, Nijel's Point), 525 (Southshore, segment 15), 563 (Stormwind, segment 14),
# 1179 (Shimmering Flats, segment 13), 1264 (Theramore, segment 13).
# Carry-out: 525, 563, 1179, 1264 untouched, plus 1457 and 1467 (both for Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge, segment 14).
@carry 525,563,1026,1179,1264,1302,1453,98209,98463
@done 1024,1034

# ---------- Astranaar and the Shrine of Aessina ----------
T 98209 @ Darkshore, 37.4, 40.1 | Thundris Windweaver, the elder in the building at the north end of Auberdine: hand him Nord'el
FLY Astranaar @ Darkshore, 36.3, 45.6 | Caylais Moonfeather, on the Auberdine dock where the boat lands
S Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 37.0, 49.2 | Innkeeper Kimlya. You hearth back here twice in this segment
A 1035 | Pelturas Whitemoon, Astranaar (37.4,51.8)
A 4581 | Shindrell Swiftfire, Astranaar (34.7,48.8)
A 1022 | Take the road west to the Shrine of Aessina (22,53). Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow. The quest text says Forest Song, but Questie and ForeverChanges both place her here
A 1021 | Illiyana, the dryad next to her
A 86757 @ Ashenvale, 49.4, 67.0 | Back east through Astranaar, then south-east to Silverwind Refuge on Mystral Lake. Shandrina (new in Forever). The orcs for it are in the far south-east: you kill them on the loop below

# ---------- East loop: Howling Vale, the treants, Shael'dryn ----------
C 1022 @ Ashenvale, 50.5, 39.1 | Go north across the road into the Howling Vale. The Tome of Mel'Thandris stands in the ruined shrine at 50.5,39.1; the way in is through the short cave at 53.0,37.6. Worgen (27-30) stand close together: pull singles, and leave the rare if one is up. Click the tome
C 1026 @ Ashenvale, 56.5, 36.5 | East of the vale, along the road to Felwood: Withered Ancients (26-27, at 54-59,33-42) and Crazed Ancients (27-28, at 57-62,31-45) drop the Wooden Key. Then open the Worn Chest in the small glade west of the road at 54.4,35.4 for the Iron Shaft
T 1026 | Shael'dryn, the dryad at the moonwell beside the main road (53.5,46.2)
A 1027 | Shael'dryn. The last rod piece is at Dor'danil in the south-east: you pick it up later on this loop

# ---------- Xavian and Forest Song ----------
T 1021 | Follow the main road east. Anilia lies at the edge of the Xavian satyr camp, north of the road (78.3,44.8). Kill the one or two satyrs next to her; the rest of the camp comes later
A 1031 | Anilia
T 4581 | Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song, at the east end of the road (85.2,44.7)
A 1011 | Kayneth Stillwind
A 98417 | Maseara Autumnmoon, Forest Song (new in Forever)
C 98417 @ Ashenvale, 81.0, 50.0 | Satyrnaar, the satyr camp south-west of Forest Song (about 80-82,48-52). Find the Vine-Wrapped Scroll: the data does not say whether it drops from the satyrs (28-30) or lies in the camp, so kill and look around. Hellcallers cast: kill them first, and interrupt or stun their casts if your class can
T 98417 | Maseara Autumnmoon
A 98418 | Maseara Autumnmoon
C 98418,1031 @ Ashenvale, 78.4, 45.4 | Xavian (77-80,42-48): 5 Xavian Rogues, 5 Felsworn, 5 Betrayers and 5 Hellcallers (28-30). There are only 2 Betrayer spawns: wait for them to come back. Geltharis (32) stands at the north end at 78.0,42.4: clear around him, rest to full, then fight him alone; interrupt or stun his casts if your class can. He drops the Branch of Cenarius
T 98418 @ Ashenvale, 86.3, 45.8 | Maseara Autumnmoon at Forest Song. The ForeverChanges page also shows a hand-in at Satyrnaar (81.0,50.2): if she is not at Forest Song, look there

# ---------- Dor'danil, Fallen Sky Lake, the orcs ----------
C 1011 @ Ashenvale, 75.3, 72.0 | South from Forest Song, past the Warsong lumber camp (stay west of it). The Forsaken camp is outside the Dor'danil Barrow Den; the Bottles of Disease stand on the ground at 75.3,72.0. Forsaken here are 28-30 and stealthed in part: walk in at full health
C 1027 @ Ashenvale, 76.0, 73.5 | The Rusty Chest with the Iron Pommel is at Dor'danil too. Its spot is not in the data: check in front of and just inside the barrow den entrance and along the hill behind the Forsaken camp
C 86757 @ Ashenvale, 70.0, 79.0 | Warsong orcs (scouts and grunts, about 28-30) drop Jagged Orcish Swords (6) and Curved Orcish Daggers (4). ForeverChanges saw the drops south-west of Dor'danil toward Fallen Sky Lake (65-75,75-85) and around the lumber camp south of Forest Song (85-90,50-65). Camps are Horde-flagged: pull stragglers at the edges
C 1035 @ Ashenvale, 66.7, 82.2 | Fallen Sky Lake: the Shadethicket Oracle (30) stands on the island in the middle (66.7,82.2). Bark Rippers and Stone Movers around it are 25-27. He drops the Fallen Moonstone
T 1011 | Back north to Kayneth Stillwind at Forest Song (finish the orc weapons at the lumber camp on the way if you are short)
A 1012 | Kayneth Stillwind
C 1012 @ Ashenvale, 76.8, 73.6 | Back to the Dor'danil Barrow Den, this time inside: Taneel Darkwood (77.2,74.0), Uthil Mooncall (78.0,72.7) and Mavoris Cloudsbreak (75.1,74.2), all level 32, with Severed druids (28-30) between them. Clear each room first. They cast heals and roots: interrupt or stun the heals if your class can; Escape Artist breaks the roots
T 1012 | Kayneth Stillwind
F Talrendis Point @ Azshara, 11.9, 77.6 | Follow the road east from Forest Song over the bridge into Azshara. Talrendis Point is right behind the border; Jarrodenus is the hippogryph master
FLY Astranaar | Jarrodenus

