T 1022 | West to the Shrine of Aessina. Sentinel Melyria Frostshadow. Do not take Velinde Starsong: it sends you to Darnassus
T 1031 | Illiyana. Do not take Satyr Slaying!: you are done with the satyrs

# ---------- Silverwind Refuge and the Bloodtooth furbolgs ----------
T 86757 @ Ashenvale, 49.4, 67.0 | Back east and south to Silverwind Refuge. Shandrina
T 1030 | Krolg, the friendly furbolg on the south shore of Mystral Lake (50.8,75.1). Use Dartol's Rod of Transformation before you talk to him: he only speaks to furbolgs
A 1045 | Krolg (still transformed)
C 1045 @ Ashenvale, 54.8, 78.1 | The Bloodtooth camp just south-east of Krolg (54-56,75-80): 4 Bloodtooth Guards (27-28) and Ran Bloodtooth (30, at the back, 54.8,79.6). Easy at your level; taking damage ends the furbolg form
T 1045 | Krolg (use the rod again)
A 1046 | Krolg
H Astranaar | Hearthstone to Astranaar
T 1046 | Raene Wolfrunner
N Repair, buy food and water. Then go to Desolace on foot | South out of Astranaar to the Talondeep Path (the tunnel at Ashenvale 42.3,71.0). It comes out in Windshear Crag in the Stonetalon Mountains. Follow the road west and then south-west past Sun Rock Retreat (Horde: stay on the far side of the lake) into the Charred Vale, and leave it by the pass at its south end into Desolace. A long walk, 15 minutes or more. Charred Vale mobs are 26-30

# ---------- Nijel's Point ----------
F Nijel's Point @ Desolace, 64.7, 10.5 | Nijel's Point is in the hills in the north-east of Desolace; the path up starts from the road east of the Thunder Axe Fortress. Baritanas Skyriver is the hippogryph master
S Nijel's Point @ Desolace, 66.3, 6.5 | Innkeeper Lyshaerya
