# ---------- Loop 1: the Malem wagon and Sargeron ----------
T 1437 | The Malem Chest in the wrecked wagon west of Nijel's Point, by the road (56.5,17.8)
A 1465 | The same chest
T 1465 | Back up to Vahlarriel Demonslayer
A 1438 | Vahlarriel Demonslayer
A 97284 @ Desolace, 66.4, 11.8 | Vahlarriel Demonslayer (new in Forever). The data has no giver for it; its text fits this moment. If she does not offer it yet, take it after the escort and skip its steps until then
C 1458 @ Desolace, 75.5, 19.5 | Sargeron, the satyr ruins east of Nijel's Point (71-81,9-30). Any Hatefury satyr (31-33) drops claws and horns: 10 each. Rogues and Shadowstalkers are stealthed, Hellcallers and Felsworn cast: kill the casters first and interrupt or stun their casts if your class can. Work along the outer edge of the ruins so only one comes at a time. Kill the Scorpashi Snappers you pass from now on and keep their venom
T 1458 | Kreldig Ungor
A 1459 | Kreldig Ungor: 7 Scorpashi Venom and 3 Aged Kodo Hides

# ---------- Loop 2: Ethel Rethor, the coast, Thunder Axe Fortress ----------
C 1459 @ Desolace, 56.0, 22.0 | On the way west: Scorpashi Snappers (30-31) are all over the north of the zone; Aged Kodos (34-35) walk along the main road south of Thunder Axe (45-59,19-83). A kodo is a long fight at 33: start at full health, with nothing else close by, and rest after each one. Hides do not always drop
A 5741 | Azore Aldamort, in the tower at Ethel Rethor on the west coast (38.9,27.2)
A 6161 | Rackmore's Log, on the beach at the shipwreck just south-west of the tower (36.1,30.4)
T 1454 | Karnitol's Chest, in the same wreck (36.1,30.5)
A 1455 | Karnitol's Chest
C 6161:1 @ Desolace, 30.0, 33.0 | Rackmore's Silver Key: Drysnap Crawlers and Pincers (33-35), the makrura on the beach and in the shallows south of the wreck (18-35,28-84)
C 6161:2 @ Desolace, 37.0, 23.0 | Rackmore's Golden Key: any Slitherblade naga. The Nagas and Sorceresses at the ruins just north of the tower (33-42,19-28) are 32-33. Sorceresses cast: kill them first, and interrupt or stun their casts if your class can
C 97284,5741 @ Desolace, 55.0, 27.0 | East to Thunder Axe Fortress (52-58,21-33). Kill 4 each of Burning Blade Augurs, Reavers, Adepts and Felsworn (30-32). The Sceptre of Light is carried by the Burning Blade Seer on top of one of the watchtowers: fight your way up the ramp. Casters everywhere: step back behind a wall or the doorway so they have to walk to you, and never fight three
T 1438 | Dalinda Malem, held inside the fortress (54.9,26.1)
A 1439 | Dalinda Malem
C 1439 @ Desolace, 53.0, 29.1 | Tyranis Malem (36) is at 53.0,29.1, in the south-west part of the fortress. He is 2-3 levels above you and casts: clear the room, rest to full, use every cooldown and potion you have, and interrupt or stun his casts if your class can. He drops Tyranis' Pendant. If he is too strong, come back after the coast loop
T 1439 | Dalinda Malem
A 1440 | Dalinda Malem. Clear the way to the gate first: it is an escort
C 1440 @ Desolace, 56.5, 28.5 | Walk Dalinda out of the fortress. Stay in front of her and keep the attackers on you (you may not be able to heal her); it ends at the gate
T 1440 | Back up to Nijel's Point. Vahlarriel Demonslayer
T 97284 @ Desolace, 66.4, 11.8 | Vahlarriel Demonslayer
T 1455 | Kreldig Ungor
A 1456 | Kreldig Ungor
T 1459 | Kreldig Ungor (if the venom and hides are done; otherwise on your next visit)
A 1466 | Kreldig Ungor. Mannoroc Coven demons are 37-40: this is the last thing you do in Desolace

# ---------- Loop 3: Azore, Ranazjar Isle ----------
T 5741 | Back west to Azore Aldamort at Ethel Rethor
A 6027 | Azore Aldamort. He gives you the Gem of the Serpent
C 1456 @ Desolace, 30.5, 11.0 | Swim north-west to Ranazjar Isle (28-35,6-17). Karnitol's Satchel drops from Slitherblade Tidehunters (36-37) and Sea Witches (35-36), about one in five. They are 2-4 levels above you: one at a time, on land, at full health; interrupt or stun the witches' casts if your class can. Get the Golden Key here if you still need it
C 6027 @ Desolace, 28.5, 7.0 | Put the Gem of the Serpent in the hand of the Serpent Statue on the isle (its exact spot is not in the data; it is the large naga statue). Lord Kragaru (38) appears: he is 4-5 levels above you. Clear the area first, rest to full, and use every cooldown and potion you have (if you have a pet, send it first). He drops the Book of the Ancients. Too strong? Abandon 6027
T 6161 | Rackmore's Chest on the isle (30.0,8.7): it needs both keys
T 6027 | Azore Aldamort
H Nijel's Point | Hearthstone (last used in Ashenvale, so it is ready). Not ready? Walk the road east past Thunder Axe and up the path
T 1456 | Kreldig Ungor
A 1457 | Kreldig Ungor. The satchel goes to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: you keep it until segment 14
A 261 | Brother Anton (66.5,7.9). Needs level 34: if you are not 34 yet, take it on your next visit here, before the last loop

# ---------- Loop 4: Kormek's Hut, Kolkar, the kodo graveyard, Magram, Gelkis ----------
A 5501 | Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut (62.3,39.0). Bibbly F'utzbuckle. Needs level 33
A 5821 | Cork Gizelton, with the kodo caravan (60.4,38.1). Only when the caravan is standing at Kormek's Hut; otherwise skip the three 5821 steps
C 5821 @ Desolace, 66.0, 45.0 | Walk with the caravan past the Kolkar village and kill the centaurs that attack it. It ends south of the village
C 1387,93224 @ Desolace, 71.5, 45.5 | Kolkar Village, east of Kormek's Hut (68-75,39-52): Kolkar are 30-33. Every centaur drops Centaur Ears (15 needed); the Carved Centaur Totems (5) come from centaurs of any clan too. You get more of both from the Magram later
A 5561 | Road south to Scrabblescrew's Camp (60.9,61.9). Smeed Scrabblescrew
T 5821 | Smeed Scrabblescrew (only if you escorted the caravan)
A 5943 | Rigger Gizelton, with the caravan, when it stands at Scrabblescrew's Camp. Demons of 37-39 attack it at Mannoroc Coven: take it only if the caravan is here and you are at least 35; otherwise skip the three 5943 steps
C 5943 @ Desolace, 56.0, 72.0 | Walk with the caravan past Mannoroc Coven and kill what attacks it
T 5943 | Smeed Scrabblescrew
C 5561,5501 @ Desolace, 51.5, 60.0 | The Kodo Graveyard, west of the camp (46-54,57-64). Pick up 10 Kodo Bones from the bone piles. Use the Kodo Kombobulator on an Aged, Dying or Ancient Kodo (34-37) to tame it, walk it back to Smeed and talk to it there; five times, one kodo at a time
T 5561 | Smeed Scrabblescrew
C 1382 @ Desolace, 69.5, 74.5 | Magram Village in the south-east (65-76,66-83). Kill Magram centaurs (32-36) until you are Friendly with the Gelkis Clan; each kill shows the gain in the chat log. How many it takes is not in the data: plan for a long grind. Scouts, Wranglers and Windchasers at the north edge are 32-34; Windchasers and Stormers cast, so kill them first and interrupt or stun their casts if your class can. Stay away from Khan Jehn (37) in the middle. Finish your ears and totems here
T 1382 | West along the south road to Gelkis Village. Uthek the Wise stands at the north edge (36.2,79.2). The Gelkis no longer attack you
A 1384 | Uthek the Wise: 10 Crude Charms from the Kolkar
A 6132 | North up the coast to the Valley of Spears. Melizza Brimbuzzle is held in the Maraudine camp (33.9,53.5). Needs level 34. Maraudine centaurs are 35-39: clear a path to her and out again before you accept
C 6132 @ Desolace, 40.0, 57.0 | Escort Melizza east out of the valley. Stay beside her and keep the attackers on you; you may not be able to heal her
T 6132 | Hornizz Brimbuzzle, at the camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard (47.8,61.8)
A 6134 | Hornizz Brimbuzzle. For the last loop
T 5501 | Back north along the road to Kormek's Hut. Bibbly F'utzbuckle
C 1384 @ Desolace, 71.5, 45.5 | Kolkar Village again: Crude Charms drop from every Kolkar, best from Windchasers and Scouts
H Nijel's Point | Hearthstone. This loop takes well over an hour, so it is ready; if not, walk the road north from Kormek's Hut
T 1387 | Corporal Melkins. Take Down the Scarlet Path (261) from Brother Anton now if you could not before
T 93224 @ Desolace, 66.6, 11.0 | Captain Pentigast. His hand-in text hints at a follow-up delivery to a clan (not in the data): if he offers one for the Gelkis, take it along to Uthek on the next loop

# ---------- Loop 5: Gelkis, Magram meat, Valley of Bones, Mannoroc Coven ----------
T 1384 | The long run south-west to Uthek the Wise at Gelkis Village (36.2,79.2): road south past Kormek's Hut and the Kodo Graveyard, then south-west. Check that you are still Friendly
A 1370 | Uthek the Wise
C 1370 @ Desolace, 70.5, 76.5 | East to Magram Village: 6 bags of Crudely Dried Meat from the Sacks of Meat beside the tents (65.8,80.5 / 69.2,77.3 / 70.9,75.4 / 73.5,73.8 and more)
C 261,6134 @ Desolace, 63.0, 89.0 | The Valley of Bones, south of Magram Village (58-65,82-92). Undead Ravagers are 37-38 and you need 30: one at a time, at full health, and eat, drink or bandage after every fight. If they are still orange and each fight nearly kills you, abandon 261. For Hornizz: place a Ghost Magnet between the two giant skeletons (63.5,91.6), step back and kill the Magrami Spectres (38-39) that walk to it one by one; 8 Ghost-o-plasms
C 1466 @ Desolace, 53.0, 78.0 | Mannoroc Coven, west of the valley (51-58,69-85): 10 Felhound Brains from Mage Hunters (38-39, at 53-58,73-79), 10 Nether Wings from Nether Sorceresses (39-40) and 10 Doomwarder Blood from Doomwarder Captains (38), both at the south end around 51.7,83.4. Felhounds drain mana: kill them fast. This is the hardest step of the segment: if you cannot kill a Sorceress at 35, abandon 1466; segment 14 then has only the satchel (1457) for Ironforge
T 1370 | Uthek the Wise, Gelkis Village. Do not take Ongeku (1373): the Draenethyst Shard is in the Swamp of Sorrows on the other continent, and the route does not come back here afterwards
T 6134 | Hornizz Brimbuzzle, Kodo Graveyard
H Nijel's Point | Hearthstone. If it is still on cooldown, walk the road north past Kormek's Hut (about 8 minutes)
T 261 | Brother Anton. Do not take his next quest: it sends you to the Scarlet Monastery line
T 1466 | Kreldig Ungor
A 1467 | Kreldig Ungor. Leftwitch's Package goes to Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge (segment 14)
N Segment done. In the log: 525, 563, 1179, 1264, 1457, 1467 | Next: fly from Nijel's Point to Astranaar. Your hearthstone stays at Nijel's Point
